      "title": "PARTIAL (MC-2 symmetry error) → \"φ(−z)=φ(z) (the DENSITY is symmetric). But Φ(−z)=1−Φ(z) (the CDF satisfies this, not Φ(−z)=Φ(z)). Draw the bell curve: P(Z<−1)=the LEFT tail probability = 1−P(Z<1)=1−Φ(1)≈0.159, not 0.841.\" → TB-R01 → Gate",
