      "conceptId": "math.prob.standard-normal",
      "title": "NO_RESPONSE → \"X~N(100,25). Compute P(X>110). Step 1: z=(110−100)/5=2. Step 2: P(X>110)=P(Z>2)=1−Φ(2)≈1−0.977=0.023.\" → TB-R01 → Gate",
